  "evidencia": "Page: Symbolic Manipulation Program. Sentence: Symbolic Manipulation Program, usually called SMP, was a computer algebra system designed by Chris A. Cole and Stephen Wolfram at Caltech circa 1979 and initially developed in the Caltech physics department under Wolfram's leadership with contributions from Geoffrey C. Fox, Jeffrey M. Greif, Eric D. Mjolsness, Larry J. Romans, Timothy Shaw, and Anthony E. Terrano.\nPage: Stephen Wolfram. Sentence: He is the author of the book \"A New Kind of Science.\"",
